00:46:30.341 [transcriber] seg[304] KEEP      start=1459.46 end=1460.22 nsp=0.3069  text='Сейчас чтоб последний тепвал'
00:46:30.343 [transcriber] seg[305] KEEP      start=1460.22 end=1462.70 nsp=0.3069  text='Чее асно-ным собаки голодают'
00:46:30.344 [transcriber] seg[306] KEEP      start=1463.70 end=1465.50 nsp=0.3069  text='Дианно если ты сейчас ни отстанишь'
00:46:30.345 [transcriber] seg[307] KEEP      start=1465.50 end=1466.68 nsp=0.3069  text='Сейчас все моросскажу'
00:46:30.347 [transcriber] seg[308] KEEP      start=1466.68 end=1468.24 nsp=0.3069  text='Кофить ты собаку'
00:46:30.348 [transcriber] seg[309] KEEP      start=1468.24 end=1469.16 nsp=0.3069  text="C'да verloren"
00:46:30.348 [transcriber] seg[310] KEEP      start=1469.16 end=1470.02 nsp=0.3069  text='Не это'
00:46:30.350 [transcriber] seg[311] KEEP      start=1470.42 end=1472.38 nsp=0.3069  text='Not holidays'
00:46:30.351 [transcriber] seg[312] KEEP      start=1472.38 end=1473.50 nsp=0.3069  text='Но давай'
00:46:30.351 [transcriber] seg[313] KEEP      start=1474.20 end=1474.90 nsp=0.3069  text='Ннв thumb-покple'
00:46:30.352 [transcriber] seg[314] KEEP      start=1476.14 end=1477.86 nsp=0.3069  text='Теперь я accede тебе оension'
00:46:30.354 [transcriber] seg[315] KEEP      start=1478.70 end=1479.66 nsp=0.3069  text='Я еще жоп, она родилась'
00:46:30.356 [transcriber] seg[316] KEEP      start=1479.66 end=1481.32 nsp=0.3069  text='Просто без чувства уничеловек'
00:46:30.357 [transcriber] seg[317] KEEP      start=1481.32 end=1483.50 nsp=0.3069  text='Давай'
